/*!
\page page_sttofhit StTofHit

\brief Reconstructed hit in the legacy STAR Time-of-Flight (TOF) detector with PID information.

\section tofhit_overview Overview

StTofHit represents a fully reconstructed hit in the legacy STAR TOF detector —
the MRPC-based barrel TOF system used from approximately Run 3 through Run 7,
before the full BTOF installation in Run 8.

\note This class is superseded by \ref StBTofHit for Run 8 and later data.

Beyond geometry and raw timing, StTofHit provides particle-identification (PID) data:
measured time of flight, expected TOF under each mass hypothesis (e, π, K, p),
and the corresponding number-of-sigma deviations.

Hits are stored in \ref StTofCollection via StEvent::tofCollection().

\section tofhit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StHit → StTofHit
\endcode

\section tofhit_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mTrayIndex | Int_t | TOF tray index |
| mModuleIndex | Int_t | Module index within tray |
| mCellIndex | Int_t | Cell index within module |
| mDaqIndex | Int_t | DAQ channel index (255 = unassigned) |
| mCellCollIndex | Int_t | Index of the associated StTofCell in the collection |
| mTimeOfFlight | Float_t | Measured time of flight [ns] |
| mPathLength | Float_t | Track path length from vertex to hit [cm] |
| mBeta | Float_t | Particle velocity β = v/c |
| mAssociatedTrack | StLink<StTrack> | Matched reconstructed track |
| mTOFExpectedAsElectron | Float_t | Expected TOF for electron hypothesis [ns] |
| mTOFExpectedAsPion | Float_t | Expected TOF for pion hypothesis [ns] |
| mTOFExpectedAsKaon | Float_t | Expected TOF for kaon hypothesis [ns] |
| mTOFExpectedAsProton | Float_t | Expected TOF for proton hypothesis [ns] |
| mSigmaElectron | Float_t | nσ from electron hypothesis (default 999) |
| mSigmaPion | Float_t | nσ from pion hypothesis |
| mSigmaKaon | Float_t | nσ from kaon hypothesis |
| mSigmaProton | Float_t | nσ from proton hypothesis |
| mParticleHypothesis | StParticleDefinition* | Best PID hypothesis |

\section tofhit_methods Key Methods

- timeOfFlight() — measured TOF [ns]
- pathLength() — track path length [cm]
- beta() — particle velocity v/c
- tofExpectedAsPion() / AsKaon() / AsProton() / AsElectron() — expected TOF [ns]
- sigmaPion() / sigmaKaon() / sigmaProton() / sigmaElectron() — PID nσ
- associatedTrack() — pointer to StTrack
- detector() — detector ID from inherited bit field

\section tofhit_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
// Legacy pre-Run8 data only
StTofCollection* coll = event->tofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecTofHit& hits = coll->tofHits();
    for (const auto& h : hits) {
        float tof   = h->timeOfFlight();    // [ns]
        float beta  = h->beta();
        float nSigPi = h->sigmaPion();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StTofCell, StTofData, StTofCollection, StBTofHit
*/
